{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋にて、\n全国握手会\n個別握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日続けて開催されました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/04/30/0982500/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった皆さん本当にありがとうございました〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会はあやねちゃんとペアでしたよん！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/04/30/0982500/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイクさんが同じだからか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田出身コンビ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃ髪のセット似てる〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"姉妹？って言われたな〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁ、姉妹じゃないけど、かわいい妹であり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同郷の仲間ですっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり東京に行くって相当覚悟したよね〜って話したり、お互い好きな仮面ライダーの話したりと和気あいあいに皆さんをお待ちしていました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/04/30/0982500/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は個別握手会！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/04/30/0982500/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"濡れ髪好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/04/30/0982500/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パーマかけたい所だけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり今は我慢ね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/04/30/0982500/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/04/30/0982500/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洋服はMILK"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、よくお洋服変えないの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と質問来ますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変えない理由の一番はお洋服高くていっぱい買えないからでする笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"例えば3着買ったとしたら、3会場で着たいじゃないですか笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"貯金しつつなので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもお洋服欲しいから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう節約してます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/04/30/0982500/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/04/30/0982500/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、あと個別握手会全会場完売しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様のお陰ですねヽ(・∀・)ノヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分らしい、でも皆さんが楽しめる握手頑張りますっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/04/30/0982500/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ANNA SUIムック本好評でございます〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/04/30/0982500/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このお洋服買おうかしらっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊勢丹行きたいなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ、お買い物したいなぁ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"したいなぁ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"したい〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"したい〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"したい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"死体"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"英語で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"corpse"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コープスパーティーのポス